{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-42399","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47208","text":"--- name: deliberate description: Use when retrieve returns routing \"deliberate\", when κ > 0 is detected, before high-stakes decisions with cyclic knowledge, or when the user asks to \"deliberate\", \"reason through cycles\", \"analyze topology\", \"think through this carefully\". For detecting contradictions use "},{"id":"spn-47209","marks":["code"],"text":"belief"},{"id":"spn-47210","text":"; this skill reasons through cyclic structures once detected. Routes through the "},{"id":"spn-47211","marks":["code"],"text":"route"},{"id":"spn-47212","text":" machine. argument-hint: <question or decision to deliberate on> ---"}]},{"id":"blk-42400","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47213","text":"Topology and Deliberation"}]},{"id":"blk-42401","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47214","text":"Detect and reason through circular dependencies (cycles) in knowledge."}]},{"id":"blk-42402","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47215","text":"Key Concepts"}]},{"id":"blk-42403","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47216","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-47217","text":" is the cycle-complexity invariant — it measures how entangled the knowledge is:"}]},{"id":"blk-42404","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42406","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47218","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 0"},{"id":"spn-47219","text":" — acyclic DAG, no cycles. Safe for fast retrieval."}]}],"id":"blk-42405","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42408","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47220","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 1"},{"id":"spn-47221","text":" — simple cycle (A->B->C->A). Deliberation may help for high-stakes decisions."}]}],"id":"blk-42407","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42410","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47222","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 2+"},{"id":"spn-47223","text":" — nested/overlapping cycles. Deliberation strongly recommended."}]}],"id":"blk-42409","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-42411","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47224","marks":["bold"],"text":"SCCs (Strongly Connected Components)"},{"id":"spn-47225","text":" are maximal cyclic clusters — groups of nodes where every node can reach every other node through directed edges."}]},{"id":"blk-42412","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47226","marks":["bold"],"text":"Fault-line edges"},{"id":"spn-47227","text":" are the weakest links in a cycle — the assumptions most likely to be wrong. Examining these first is the fastest path to resolving contradictions."}]},{"id":"blk-42413","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47228","text":"Arguments"}]},{"id":"blk-42414","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47229","text":"Question to deliberate: $ARGUMENTS"}]},{"id":"blk-42415","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47230","text":"Analyze Topology"}]},{"id":"blk-42416","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47231","text":"Read-only diagnostic — understand the structure:"}]},{"id":"blk-42417","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"<topic>\")"},{"id":"blk-42418","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47232","marks":["bold"],"text":"Parameters:"}]},{"id":"blk-42419","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42421","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47233","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-47234","text":" (optional) — explicit array of node IDs to analyze"}]}],"id":"blk-42420","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42423","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47235","marks":["code"],"text":"query"},{"id":"spn-47236","text":" (optional) — retrieve nodes by query, then analyze"}]}],"id":"blk-42422","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42425","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47237","text":"Neither — analyzes full graph"}]}],"id":"blk-42424","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-42426","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47238","text":"If both "},{"id":"spn-47239","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-47240","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-47241","marks":["code"],"text":"query"},{"id":"spn-47242","text":" are provided, "},{"id":"spn-47243","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-47244","text":" takes precedence."}]},{"id":"blk-42427","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47245","marks":["bold"],"text":"Response fields:"}]},{"id":"blk-42428","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47246","marks":["code"],"text":"routing"},{"id":"spn-47247","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47248","marks":["code"],"text":"\"fast\""},{"id":"spn-47249","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-47250","marks":["code"],"text":"\"deliberate\""}]}],"id":"blk-42429","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42432","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47251","marks":["code"],"text":"max_kappa"},{"id":"spn-47252","text":" — highest kappa value found"}]}],"id":"blk-42431","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42434","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47253","marks":["code"],"text":"sccs"},{"id":"spn-47254","text":" — array of strongly connected components, each with its own "},{"id":"spn-47255","marks":["code"],"text":"routing"},{"id":"spn-47256","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-47257","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"}]}],"id":"blk-42433","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42436","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47258","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-47259","text":" — weakest edges in cycles (examine these first)"}]}],"id":"blk-42435","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42438","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47260","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation_budget"},{"id":"spn-47261","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47262","marks":["code"],"text":"max_iterations"},{"id":"spn-47263","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-47264","marks":["code"],"text":"focus_edges"},{"id":"spn-47265","text":" to guide deliberation effort"}]}],"id":"blk-42437","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42440","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47266","marks":["code"],"text":"recommendation"},{"id":"spn-47267","text":" — human-readable guidance"}]}],"id":"blk-42439","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42442","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47268","marks":["code"],"text":"selection"},{"id":"spn-47269","text":" — how nodes were resolved (explicit/query/full_graph)"}]}],"id":"blk-42441","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42444","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47270","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate"},{"id":"spn-47271","text":" — whether analysis used approximation for large graphs"}]}],"id":"blk-42443","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-42445","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47272","text":"Deliberate Through Cycles"}]},{"id":"blk-42446","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47273","text":"Reason through cyclic knowledge and optionally persist conclusions:"}]},{"id":"blk-42447","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"deliberate\",\n  query: \"Should we use approach A or B given the conflicting evidence?\",\n  node_ids: [\"<node1>\", \"<node2>\"],\n  write_back: true\n)"},{"id":"blk-42448","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47274","marks":["bold"],"text":"Response fields:"}]},{"id":"blk-42449","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42451","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47275","marks":["code"],"text":"conclusions"},{"id":"spn-47276","text":" — array of resolved conclusions, each with "},{"id":"spn-47277","marks":["code"],"text":"source_scc_id"},{"id":"spn-47278","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47279","marks":["code"],"text":"source_kappa"},{"id":"spn-47280","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47281","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_lines_examined"}]}],"id":"blk-42450","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42453","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47282","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.converged"},{"id":"spn-47283","text":" — whether deliberation reached stable conclusions"}]}],"id":"blk-42452","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42455","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47284","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.iterations_used"},{"id":"spn-47285","text":" — how many reasoning passes were needed"}]}],"id":"blk-42454","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42457","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47286","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.topology_change"},{"id":"spn-47287","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47288","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa_before"},{"id":"spn-47289","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47290","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa_after"},{"id":"spn-47291","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47292","marks":["code"],"text":"new_nodes_created"}]}],"id":"blk-42456","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-42458","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47293","text":"When to use "},{"id":"spn-47294","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back"}]},{"id":"blk-42459","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47295","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back: true"},{"id":"spn-47296","text":" — crystallizes conclusions as new nodes. Use when you've reached a resolution you want to persist (reduces kappa for future retrievals)."}]}],"id":"blk-42460","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42463","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47297","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back: false"},{"id":"spn-47298","text":" — reasoning only, no graph changes. Use for exploration or when you're not confident in the conclusion yet."}]}],"id":"blk-42462","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-42464","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47299","text":"Full Workflow"}]},{"id":"blk-42465","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47300","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-47301","marks":["bold"],"text":"Detect"},{"id":"spn-47302","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47303","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-47304","text":" returns "},{"id":"spn-47305","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.routing: \"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-47306","text":" 2. "},{"id":"spn-47307","marks":["bold"],"text":"Diagnose"},{"id":"spn-47308","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47309","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-47310","text":" for detailed cycle info and fault-lines 3. "},{"id":"spn-47311","marks":["bold"],"text":"Examine fault-lines"},{"id":"spn-47312","text":" — inspect the weakest edges identified in step 2 4. "},{"id":"spn-47313","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deliberate"},{"id":"spn-47314","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47315","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"...\", write_back: true)"},{"id":"spn-47316","text":" to reason through and resolve 5. "},{"id":"spn-47317","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify"},{"id":"spn-47318","text":" — re-run "},{"id":"spn-47319","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-47320","text":" to confirm kappa decreased after resolution"}]},{"id":"blk-42466","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47321","text":"When NOT to deliberate"}]},{"id":"blk-42467","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42469","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47322","text":"When "},{"id":"spn-47323","marks":["code"],"text":"routing: \"fast\""},{"id":"spn-47324","text":" — normal retrieval is sufficient"}]}],"id":"blk-42468","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42471","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47325","text":"For low-stakes decisions — deliberation has a cost"}]}],"id":"blk-42470","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42473","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47326","text":"When there are no cycles (kappa = 0) — nothing to deliberate about"}]}],"id":"blk-42472","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42475","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47327","text":"Over-deliberation is an anti-pattern — only deliberate when routing recommends it or you suspect contradictions"}]}],"id":"blk-42474","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierafbhyaynangrqi2ll4pmi4epxd7od4e4ft7g6ogm5ououpc6vpaxq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}